{"title":"Saturday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/909784784/0/marginalrevolution~Saturday-assorted-links.html","date":1734801440000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nationalreview.com/magazine/2025/02/the-bark-and-bite-of-doge/\" target=\"_blank\">Good overview on DOGE</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://evavivalt.com/wp-content/uploads/The-Impact-of-New-Products-on-Ethical-Beliefs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">The impact of new products on ethical beliefs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/evanjconrad/status/1870349922798903786?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">Speculative claims about the new economics of open source AI</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/m00260t1\" target=\"_blank\">BBC interviews me about Milei</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MatthewsLipton/status/1870455245673017561\" target=\"_blank\">Grok rates the top economists on X</a>.  This seems better than AGI, right?  Four of the top tier are GMU-affiliated.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://scottsumner.substack.com/p/modeling-inflation-dynamics?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2934833&amp;post_id=153235105&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">A lengthy Scott Sumner post on inflation dynamics</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/6766e19f-88f0-8010-9a17-fea4f7b18f07\" target=\"_blank\">commentary from o1 pro</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://cpsi.media/p/why-dollarization-works-in-ecuador?r=azxe5&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">Why dollarization works in Ecuador</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/saturday-assorted-links-489.html\">Saturday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/909784784/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/909784784/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/909784784/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/909784784/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/909784784/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/909784784/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/saturday-assorted-links-489.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/saturday-assorted-links-489.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> </div>","author":"Tyler Cowen","siteTitle":"Marginal Revolution","siteHash":"242a3a39129b36e0c574c3796ca7ef3cf8af967286c2998fabf7240d1ad52a47","entryHash":"6bf8f623632f23b9f7bd5481d5d7f2ef231f9893c7dc999f81ac22c6c484d6ac","category":"Sites"}